                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Aloe barbadensis leaf juice, cetyl alcohol, citric acid, dimethicone, disodium EDTA, D-panthenol, glycerin, glyceryl stearate, green tea extract, isopropyl myristate, licorice (glycyrrhiza glabra) root extract, petrolatum, phenoxyethanol, polysorbate 80, purified water, shea butter, sodium citrate, stearyl alcohol, tea tree (melaleuca alternifolia) oil, tocopheryl acetate, urea, willow (salix alba) bark extract, xanthan gum.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20251204"/>
            </section>
